DESCRIPTION:Pillars of Persistence: Community Voices in Fabric\n\n  \n    
 \n      \n      from $0.00\n    \n  \n\nPillars of Persistence: Community 
 Voices in FabricSunday\, June 28th 11:00am-2:00pmJoin renowned fiber artis
 t Deb Cashatt for Pillars of Persistence: Community Voices in Fabric\, a f
 ree hands-on community workshop where art becomes a collective act of expr
 ession. Participants are invited to contribute their voice\, story\, and c
 reativity to a collaborative textile artwork that will be featured in the 
 upcoming Resist and Persist exhibition. Through fabric\, texture\, and sha
 red making\, this project celebrates the strength of community\, the power
  of persistence\, and the importance of being seen and heard. No experienc
 e needed — just bring your voice and your willingness to create together
 .This event is free! Donations are encouraged. RSVP is required. \n\n\n\n\
